Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427.392,401.8)}Anpan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.63,0:01:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"N"... it's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.73,0:01:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth course: Hiroki Nakanishi, from Soukai University
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.29,0:02:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifth course: Keisuke Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see him! Nakanishi!! Look!\NFifth course: Keisuke Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see him! Nakanishi!! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anpan-man! Ow... yet another N...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.35,0:02:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey "brother"!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.67,0:02:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there another word!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.87,0:02:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look... but what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Rieko, you should cheer him, too!
