Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.03,0:02:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Cloak
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.81,0:02:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.84,0:02:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(440.198,406.6)}Tobiuo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.84,0:02:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying Fish
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying Fish
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying Fish
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying Fish
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Ami...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we can come up here without permission!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.19,0:03:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always watching him from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He promised to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that he would certainly win for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I don't doubt...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.13,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6BB8CB&\fs60\pos(324.335,388.6)}Nakanishi Hiroki
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,New Japanese record??
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,GREAT! Great, Great, Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's so cool! He's great!!\N- Don't touch me, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's sooo great!\N- Leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's....!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ami?...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.33,0:06:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:12.18,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154.658,49.4)}Yamato Keisuke
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:12.18,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(130.647,147)}Free-Style Swimmer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:12.18,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(81.025,401.4)}He will enter Eiizumi high school\N as an athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, quickly! It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:24.32,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(162.662,44.6)}Ninomiya Ami
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:24.32,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(173.867,227)}High Diver
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:31.32,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(564.442,47.8)}Nakanishi Hiroki
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:31.32,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(548.435,174.2)}Free style swimmer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:31.32,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(495.612,303.8)}Actually record-keeper in Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I met her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:54.67,Sign2,,0,0,0,,{\fs75\frz353.4\pos(314.731,20.6)}Kamisagiryo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that in this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,there are three people who look like oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pacifist...\NAnd I dislike violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.03,0:07:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,so I never kill any living creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, what she said...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.93,0:07:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,that "murderer" she was talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.35,0:07:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...was somebody else, who looks like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps... did I kill someone without knowing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.31,0:07:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She, again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Ami?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pervert!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,N-no, it's not like it seems!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, it's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- An underwear thief!\NReally, it's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- An underwear thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only hanging out the futon as usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, it's not what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.27,0:08:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Keisuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Takeshi Ogata\N\N\N\N\Ndiving athlete in the swimming club
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to say, apart that this is a pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Rieko Kinoshita\N\N\N\N\N\N\Nathletess in the tennis club\N\N\N\N\N\N\Nchool
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I had just noticed that a pair was missing from the laundry and you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.60,0:08:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It just fell here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's against the rules...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The underwear should be hang inside the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was decided in order to avoid misunderstanding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just too rowdy to be girls!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.93,0:08:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Masaru Kume\N\N\N\N\N\N\Njudo athlete, light weight
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The laundry, then the cleaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and also how you put out the garbage...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:08:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you're really making me mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so disturbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.46,0:09:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My panties!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruko Tanuma\N\NJudo athletess,\Nhigh weights
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for all the people newly entered...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...welcome to the Kamisagi dormitory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This year they're early...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.40,0:09:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,while I was clearing the garbage...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...the cherry blossoms were like "fuwaaa"...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, grammy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...Mrs administrator Shoji!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,yes, Mrs administrator Shoji,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't have time,\Nafter all we are getting scholarship from the university...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,we should hurry and go training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"Rough"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter is in junior high 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,there are girls who like to hang around all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,my daughter likes drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And so she often draws outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,..."rough" sketches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you are "rough".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.21,0:10:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Every drawing, for as good as it can be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,it always starts with a "rough" sketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, you will lay many lines on each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you will redo many sketches,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but from all those lines you have to choose your own one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ok even if it's approximate,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it's ok even
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not necessary to complete by now the rough sketches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Make more and more drafts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:10:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"Rough"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,To be incomplete, that's your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[ as-sas-sin ]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pacifist...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...that's why, if someone hates me so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...and on the top of that,\NI think that I have to spend the next 3 years together with her...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't but feel uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,#kanjisub@irc.rizon.net\Nwww.kanjisub.com
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good, that's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting higher, higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, like that! Like that!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, ok! Come on, the last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...The last 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Last 5! Oi, spurt, spurt, spurt, spurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a good stroke! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Time?... Ehm, I got both hands busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,wait a moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the whistle, the whistle...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, now I stopped it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I just stopped it and it says only one minute! It's so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.13,0:12:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,EH!? Teacher... so you did it again!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like that Keisuke is getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevermind that Ogata, just look at here rather.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I never do the twist well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,About that, you should ask Koyanagi... even if she's not so sociable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:28.82,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(151.457,43)}Kaori Koyanaghi
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:28.82,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(73.022,177.4)}Swimming Club Diving Swimmer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:28.82,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(193.076,300.6)}Dormitory
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.99,0:14:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A one-day date?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A Senior Colleague came here and told me to do a ballot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it's the tradition to do so!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.51,0:14:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The date?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But only one boy is going as a representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And they choose a girl randomly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's up to the luck of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi oi oi! What's this!? What are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A one-day date?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,ME ME ME ME!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, let's start the ballot!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When I say "go"...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Take one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready...go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruko Haruko Haruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruko Haruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uwaaa... thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't envy me! :)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me it's not true!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready... go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't beleive it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,M E . . . !?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.55,0:15:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamisagi Dormitory\N* Traditional One-Day Date *
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Date: At 9 in front of the bell tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-wHaaAAt!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.77,0:16:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't she the representative for the girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: sweet steamed bread filled with azuki cream ]\NManjuu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: sweet steamed bread filled with azuki cream ]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She said that they fought for the ballot.\N[ note: sweet steamed bread filled with azuki cream ]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Manjuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumors say that Ami Ninomiya is the girls' representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.39,0:16:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But in this case...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...it was non sense to send Keisuke there!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't do as it's written here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,we will be punished with extra cleaning hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax at the Chirorin café.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.14,0:18:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They said this afternoon it's going to rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But yesterday's forecast was wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish they were wrong today too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The forecast is supposed to miss sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, even if it rains, it's ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm doing this because I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.71,0:19:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think that I like to spend my Sunday...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...with a girl who calls me "murderer".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember a story
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: a joke with "war of Manchu" ]\N"The war of the Manjuu"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.07,0:20:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: a joke with "war of Manchu" ]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.95,0:20:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A long time ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Two stores of japanese sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Manjuu's war is started?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them was called Yamatoya,\NThe Manjuu's war is started?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.07,0:20:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them was called Yamatoya,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the other was called Ninomiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Their respective owners
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,once used to work in the same store.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.89,0:20:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They were rivals since the time before they opened their own stores
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, the owner of the Ninomiya store
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,invented the owl-shaped manju, "Hoho"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.13,0:20:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and started selling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho... ho...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But the owner of Yamatoya didn't give up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.95,0:20:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,so he imitated the other and started selling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:20:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,a horned owl-shaped manjuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A beautiful gift for everyone\N\Nthe original Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamatoya\NA beautiful gift for everyone\N\Nthe original Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He he
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It revealed to be a great hit
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably, the customers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.58,0:21:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,thought that the ears were a free extra
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.07,0:21:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He he, Ho ho
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So the stores fought again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninomiya, who was preparing the counter attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,consumed himself too much in the creation of some new product
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and ended sick in a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.71,0:21:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, saying his last words "Yamato killed me!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,in the end......
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.41,0:21:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why are you so mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.88,0:22:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all about years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.05,0:22:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After all you don't even know me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We never even talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's enough for me to know that you're the heritance of the Yamato's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.55,0:22:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And you don't even consider me as a single human being!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.72,0:22:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandpa was so important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved him too...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, I always listen to cassette tapes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.41,0:22:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody asks me "Why the tapes?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if they always make fun of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but for me they're my granpa's memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.43,0:22:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,At 1 in the afternoon,\Nyou go to watch a movie at the Moody
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Announcement: Permanently Closed
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.06,0:23:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, it's raining...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.90,0:23:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the weather forecast...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.33,0:23:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,were right for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.53,0:23:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.15,0:23:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.34,0:23:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,who lives here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.48,0:23:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,W-wait! wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.05,0:24:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she only wanted to take an umbrella...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.21,0:24:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiroki Nakanishi?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.62,0:25:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, the towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.10,0:25:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.84,0:25:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.64,0:25:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.50,0:25:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.59,0:25:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So one umbrella will be enough, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.85,0:25:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on... stop it, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.02,0:25:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.02,0:25:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh!? Brother!?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.16,0:25:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.18,0:25:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.74,0:25:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you brother and sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.06,0:25:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.11,0:25:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But you called him "brother"...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.44,0:25:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: "oniichan" means "elder brother" but\Nis also used as friendly way to call people, not necessary relatives.]\N"Brother"...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.52,0:25:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: "oniichan" means "elder brother" but\Nis also used as friendly way to call people, not necessary relatives.]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.60,0:25:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,means brother.\N[ note: "oniichan" means "elder brother" but\Nis also used as friendly way to call people, not necessary relatives.]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.37,0:25:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you say...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.04,0:25:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we are childhood friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.82,0:25:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in. I'll prepare a tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.20,0:25:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.22,0:26:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: to call somebody without the suffix -san\Nor similiar is very intimate]\NNinomiya... why here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.42,0:26:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: to call somebody without the suffix -san\Nor similiar is very intimate]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.91,0:26:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I come to work part-time here...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.45,0:26:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...when brother is away for his long journeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.10,0:26:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I come to make the cleaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.79,0:26:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He pays me 800 yen per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.03,0:26:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.80,0:26:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He said you're a "mysterious athlete".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.81,0:26:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"actually he's not making any progress, but..."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.30,0:26:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"he got talent for swimming."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.83,0:26:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"He's the kind of athlete who suddenly..."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.60,0:26:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"breaks all the previous records".
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.62,0:27:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother said...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.20,0:27:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.93,0:27:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.13,0:27:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That once...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.25,0:27:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,that he saved the Ninomiya's.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.43,0:27:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that you, with the son of the Yamato's...?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.03,0:27:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,ah, so we're all gathered!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.55,0:27:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The family of the saviour...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.38,0:27:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,the family that was about to collapse...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.75,0:27:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and the family that wanted to crush another family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.62,0:27:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you laugh about this!?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.62,0:27:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I also heard about what you were saying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.52,0:28:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhat sounded like compliments to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.83,0:28:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.04,0:28:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.94,0:28:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that you called me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.26,0:28:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"mysterious athlete"...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.88,0:28:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.82,0:28:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.15,0:28:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... yeah! ^^;;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.17,0:28:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.44,0:29:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.71,0:29:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.30,0:29:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you got something to say, then say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.24,0:29:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.51,0:29:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To look at my happy face while I didn't understand I was being fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.14,0:29:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.75,0:29:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He never said those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.52,0:29:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakanishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.96,0:29:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He never called me...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.02,0:29:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,he didn't even notice me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.75,0:30:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody called him "flying fish".
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.42,0:30:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When we attended the same pool, once...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.43,0:30:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They called Nakanishi the "flying fish".
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.36,0:30:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whilst my surname was "damedaka".
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.52,0:30:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They joined "failure" (dame) and "killifish" (medaka).
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.77,0:30:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then I moved to another club.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.12,0:30:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then I always aimed to be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.44,0:30:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in that period
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.40,0:30:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the truth was
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.35,0:31:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to make that race.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.85,0:31:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.39,0:31:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.14,0:32:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Show it in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.23,0:32:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.42,0:32:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.78,0:33:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but the answer is in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.69,0:33:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Results come after.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.16,0:33:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.56,0:33:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why this words all of sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.97,0:33:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, more or less, what you're thinking of.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.35,0:33:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As we live in the same small room...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.21,0:33:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tie it tight, tight!\NYeah like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.93,0:33:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.47,0:33:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.97,0:33:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an idiot! What are you thinking of!?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.01,0:33:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no such intentions!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.72,0:33:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.95,0:33:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Haha.\NYes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.35,0:33:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Haha.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.25,0:33:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well. Did he come?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.70,0:33:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.17,0:33:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.23,0:33:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.16,0:33:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.46,0:33:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, it's a heartbeat counter!\NOne of those "pipipi" signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.38,0:33:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,As from today, you will have to measure during the training! Got it!?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.39,0:33:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Both physical and mental care!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.53,0:33:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to reinforce more and more heart, lungs and everything! So in the next race...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.33,0:33:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be the best in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.23,0:34:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Sakiyama...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.95,0:34:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're aiming at it, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.03,0:34:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it, all together!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.50,0:34:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.03,0:34:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-what's that... ah, this!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.26,0:34:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.66,0:34:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, like that! Last five!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.30,0:34:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.39,0:35:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,1 Hiroki Nakanishi\N2 Keisuke Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.45,0:35:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.16,0:35:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.90,0:35:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look here! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.20,0:35:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that you're a "misterious athlete".
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.27,0:35:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time, before the race...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.16,0:35:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to act as a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.15,0:35:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.35,0:35:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,i need to say it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.67,0:36:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well, huh
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.00,0:36:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway you' keep ignoring me.\NNot like I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.01,0:36:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to tell you as athlete to athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.14,0:36:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...even if I've been eliminated in the qualification race.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.98,0:36:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway!!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.86,0:36:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You just did your personal record, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.09,0:36:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's always a 0.4 difference with brother's...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.73,0:36:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that Nakanishi is 0.4 seconds ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.46,0:36:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,...more important that that, I couldn't tell her yet...!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.57,0:36:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"sorry"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.36,0:37:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.91,0:37:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,summer vacations are so quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.98,0:37:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehy, why is that girl here, too??
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.89,0:37:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kume asked me to invite her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.80,0:37:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She puts on airs!!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.03,0:37:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She's always on her own and never even steps in the dormitory.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.71,0:37:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.32,0:37:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.76,0:37:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.46,0:37:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.64,0:37:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, all right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.72,0:37:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, help us to carry this stuff!!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.24,0:38:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Kume! Ogata! Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.76,0:38:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMATO!?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.82,0:38:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just say YAMATO!?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.16,0:38:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.63,0:38:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Yamato??
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.66,0:38:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,YOU?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.38,0:38:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,YOU?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.63,0:38:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Yamato!?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.57,0:38:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a school fellow, his name is YamaDA!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.49,0:39:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And... what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.98,0:39:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done with the shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.91,0:39:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakanishi, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.57,0:39:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.95,0:39:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look fit in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.94,0:39:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ami offered it to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.60,0:39:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the relationship between you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.49,0:39:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Between you and Nakanishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.50,0:40:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.58,0:40:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're like brother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.58,0:40:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A good friend to talk to...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.66,0:40:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,someone I can count on, and am proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.25,0:40:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I like him so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.86,0:40:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So you like him...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.09,0:40:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about you, Koyanagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.83,0:40:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have someone...?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.56,0:40:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,...at present?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.73,0:40:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.09,0:40:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy I'm interested in...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.70,0:40:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,is the second fastest athlete in crawl, in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.35,0:41:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure swims well.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.29,0:41:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my best athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.12,0:41:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, so it's because the master is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.73,0:41:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...He's the best in Japan, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.03,0:41:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind is arising...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.61,0:41:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't go too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.76,0:41:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.83,0:41:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time you come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.50,0:41:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.47,0:41:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, it's so noisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.25,0:41:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.42,0:41:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.99,0:42:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.58,0:42:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch me! ahah
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.82,0:43:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.33,0:43:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes!\N- Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.67,0:43:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ami!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.22,0:43:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ami!!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.90,0:43:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,By by~~e!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.99,0:43:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.89,0:43:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.87,0:43:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like today'll be really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.55,0:43:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's damn true...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.08,0:43:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you will be alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.76,0:43:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.47,0:43:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to be sure, I was visited once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.25,0:43:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Also the doctor said that there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.39,0:43:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so...?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.16,0:43:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.73,0:44:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.58,0:44:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,that I made you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.41,0:44:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ami
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.27,0:44:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: hitsumabushi: eel fillets cooked over charcoal with\Nsoy flavoured sauce, cut in small pieces and served on rice]\NLet's go eat!\Ntoday's hitsumabushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.05,0:44:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: hitsumabushi: eel fillets cooked over charcoal with\Nsoy flavoured sauce, cut in small pieces and served on rice]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.80,0:44:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eel, eel!\N[ note: hitsumabushi: eel fillets cooked over charcoal with\Nsoy flavoured sauce, cut in small pieces and served on rice]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.89,0:44:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! So cute! What's that?\N[ note: hitsumabushi: eel fillets cooked over charcoal with\Nsoy flavoured sauce, cut in small pieces and served on rice]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.27,0:44:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! So cute! What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.35,0:45:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.06,0:45:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You hide it! Let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.14,0:45:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nothing, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.01,0:45:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinneeeeer!!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.42,0:45:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Haru, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.96,0:45:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,E E L ! !
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.20,0:45:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eel, eel, eel, eel today!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.63,0:45:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if there won't be left for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.58,0:46:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.26,0:46:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.32,0:46:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have something special to say, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.69,0:46:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.94,0:46:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.33,0:46:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.16,0:46:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you can use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.03,0:46:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,whisper, whisper... careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.69,0:47:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.44,0:47:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,...thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.23,0:47:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please... just don't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.22,0:47:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.24,0:47:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm oK now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.18,0:48:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.33,0:48:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that you dived for me the other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.33,0:48:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure is fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.66,0:48:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never swim like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.65,0:48:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, he's the retainer of the national record.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.85,0:48:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So why did you dive for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.67,0:48:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.15,0:48:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.28,0:48:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all, you did dive for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.45,0:49:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The pitch is too slow!!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.91,0:49:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.13,0:49:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,oi oi oi oi oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.06,0:49:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No no no no no!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.91,0:49:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the way to swim!?!?!?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.67,0:49:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Sakiyama, you sure are positive!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.01,0:49:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he just made a personal record!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.02,0:49:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.31,0:49:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's impos-\NIT'S TRUE!!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.33,0:49:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?!?!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.57,0:49:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so calm!?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.55,0:49:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.72,0:49:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.93,0:49:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all your merit, prof. Sakiyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.40,0:49:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.46,0:49:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you spread this passion...!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.68,0:49:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato!! Hurry and come to say thanks already! Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.41,0:49:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sincerely, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.85,0:49:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, you're great!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.54,0:49:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.90,0:49:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you can do it, Yamato! Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.33,0:49:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get married... oK?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.34,0:49:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher, teacher! So, is it ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.63,0:49:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.02,0:49:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's all right to laugh like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.92,0:49:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is critic.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.74,0:50:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For that..... brother of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.48,0:50:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not particularly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.37,0:50:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.01,0:50:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...to see which one of them is going to get the support.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.42,0:50:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to miss it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.37,0:50:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato... I like you very much, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.85,0:50:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, too, Yamato! thank you, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.62,0:50:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally the Japanese championship has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.88,0:50:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! "Fifth consecutive victory?"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.01,0:50:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hiroki Nakanishi, Sokai university"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.93,0:50:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the latest edition?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.08,0:50:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.03,0:50:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.75,0:50:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"The champion"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.32,0:50:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hiroki Nakanishi"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.22,0:51:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"from Sokai University"
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.47,0:51:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"retainer of the Japanese record"
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.18,0:51:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keisuke Yamato *new promise*
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.58,0:51:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamada, alias...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.61,0:51:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.95,0:51:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.88,0:51:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato~~!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.18,0:51:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.44,0:51:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, wai-...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.71,0:51:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamisagi dormitory
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.33,0:51:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well\NKamisagi dormitory
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.83,0:51:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.67,0:51:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.53,0:51:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it's oK
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.27,0:51:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The next time we'll meet...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.43,0:52:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,it's on the day of the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.98,0:52:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.89,0:52:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... on that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.68,0:52:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not like I'm good at it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.73,0:52:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll  cook the lunch for you, so let's eat together, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.21,0:53:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"Roba" (donkey)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.50,0:53:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ba"...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.60,0:53:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ba... ba... ba...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.05,0:53:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Babaroa! (bavarian cream)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.41,0:53:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,tsumazuite korondetara\N(I stumbled and fell)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.46,0:53:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uwaa! It's so late!\Ntsumazuite korondetara\N(I stumbled and fell)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.46,0:53:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uwaa! It's so late!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.70,0:53:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,oitekarenda\N(and I've been left alone)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.80,0:53:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!\Noitekarenda\N(and I've been left alone)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.64,0:53:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,oitekarenda\N(and I've been left alone)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.17,0:53:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,doromizu no naka wo kyou mo\N(and also today, in the middle of mud)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.04,0:53:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... thank you brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.35,0:53:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,yoromekinagara susumu\N(the day goes on, even if I stagger)\NYes... thank you brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.23,0:53:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,yoromekinagara susumu\N(the day goes on, even if I stagger)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.48,0:53:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... yes, oK!\Nyoromekinagara susumu\N(the day goes on, even if I stagger)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.08,0:53:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... yes, oK!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.70,0:53:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,yogorechimatta boku no sekai\N(my world is so dirty now)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.03,0:53:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I'm waiting for you!\Nyogorechimatta boku no sekai\N(my world is so dirty now)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.28,0:53:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,yogorechimatta boku no sekai\N(my world is so dirty now)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.12,0:53:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,uita hanashi nado nai\N(I got nothing to be merry about)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.49,0:53:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,shimitsuita kodoku ronri\N(the logic of loneliness, sticking inside me)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.32,0:53:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,nuguenaku natte iru\N(will never scrape away from me)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.75,0:53:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A... a...\Nnuguenaku natte iru\N(will never scrape away from me)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.65,0:53:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A... a...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.16,0:53:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,tamesarete made mo (to the point to try me out)\NA... a...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.35,0:53:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,tamesarete made mo (to the point to try me out)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.05,0:53:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Anpan\Ntamesarete made mo (to the point to try me out)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.15,0:53:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Anpan
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.15,0:53:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,koko ni iru koto wo kimeta noni\N(even if I decided to stay here)\NAnpan
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.24,0:53:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,koko ni iru koto wo kimeta noni\N(even if I decided to stay here)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.63,0:53:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no...\Nkoko ni iru koto wo kimeta noni\N(even if I decided to stay here)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.62,0:53:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,koko ni iru koto wo kimeta noni\N(even if I decided to stay here)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.26,0:53:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A... a... a...\Nkoko ni iru koto wo kimeta noni\N(even if I decided to stay here)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.53,0:53:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A... a... a...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.59,0:53:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,jumon no you ni\N(like an enchantment)\NA... a... a...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.97,0:53:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,jumon no you ni\N(like an enchantment)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.37,0:53:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,shikata nai to tsubuyaiteta\N(I whispered "there's nothing I can do about it")
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.03,0:53:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Anpanman!\Nshikata nai to tsubuyaiteta\N(I whispered "there's nothing I can do about it")
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.36,0:53:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Anpanman!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.47,0:53:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,tsumiageta mono bukkowashite\N(let's make in pieces all we've been piling up)\NAnpanman!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.87,0:53:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,tsumiageta mono bukkowashite\N(let's make in pieces all we've been piling up)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.95,0:54:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,mi ni tsuketa mono topparatte\N(let's trow away all the schemes)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.54,0:54:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,tometonai chi to ase de\N(with endless blood and sweat)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.82,0:54:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,kawaita nou wo uruwase\N(give some new vigor to the thirsty brain)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.93,0:54:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,ano koro no bokura wa kitto\N(at that time, we...)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.12,0:54:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,zenryoku de shounen datta\N(...were young men full of energy)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.92,0:54:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamisagi dormitory\Nzenryoku de shounen datta\N(...were young men full of energy)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.73,0:54:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamisagi dormitory
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.02,0:54:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,sekai wo hiraku no wa dare da?\N(who will open the new world?)\NKamisagi dormitory
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.16,0:54:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamisagi dormitory
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.06,0:54:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,asobu koto wasuretetara\N(when one forgets how to have fun)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.33,0:54:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,oite karenda\N(one gets old and withers)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.01,0:54:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,kokontoko wa shigoto onrii\N(now it's all about work...)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.60,0:54:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,waraenaku natte iru\N(and can't even laugh anymore)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.51,0:55:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Keisuke, Keisuke, Keisuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.31,0:56:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiroki Nakanishi\Nheavily injured in a car accident
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.10,0:56:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ami
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.34,0:56:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye bye
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.13,0:56:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.78,0:56:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[ note: They're at English lesson ]\N...he be of soul who could pass by
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.68,0:56:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A sight so touching in its majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.23,0:57:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This city now doth, like a garment
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.32,0:57:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, who wants to translate until this point?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.00,0:57:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want the lunch to be warmed once more?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.27,0:58:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[ amulet for road safety ]
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.11,0:58:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you come to the training?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.28,0:58:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The teacher is on the rag
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.77,0:58:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,he says you don't want to do nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.96,0:58:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The champion can
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.90,0:58:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keisuke
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.20,0:58:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what's your weak point?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.55,0:58:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to jump
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.56,0:58:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at 10 meters
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.97,0:59:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same height as when we dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.61,0:59:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.09,0:59:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I would die...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.40,0:59:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We always dive from such height
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.38,0:59:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we get mad when we see someone like you,\Nwho retires in his shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.35,0:59:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.29,0:59:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.74,0:59:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time that something happens,\Nyou always make a face as if nothing were.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.16,0:59:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and squash your feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.73,0:59:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and close with a shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.10,0:59:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, you're suddenly serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.53,0:59:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just natural!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.62,0:59:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Being serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.39,0:59:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,getting angry, crying, suffering
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.89,0:59:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,in the reality, there are such things!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.35,1:00:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to take it all out!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.24,1:00:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fighting for a 0.01 second!!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.85,1:00:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't break this shell and take things seriously,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.84,1:00:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,for as pathetic as it can be,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.46,1:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to take it all out!!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.40,1:00:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise you'll never be able to win!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.02,1:01:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.83,1:01:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm wicked, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.59,1:02:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're skipping class again!?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.92,1:02:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If you got nothing to do, then help me already
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.56,1:02:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.79,1:02:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That... Ogata, who lives in the same room as you
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.03,1:02:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,did you know he will be leaving the dormitory?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.80,1:02:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Announcement to all athletes...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.43,1:02:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,please gather in the main hall...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.25,1:03:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I wanted to hide it from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.44,1:03:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was planning to talk to you about it after the competition.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.29,1:03:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because... you don't want to be emotional?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.28,1:03:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.08,1:03:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already a long time
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.89,1:03:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,that my father is sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.48,1:03:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he doesn't have much time left to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.22,1:03:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to go back home and take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.75,1:03:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Today it's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.32,1:03:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me!\N- Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.06,1:03:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Ogata and Yamato, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.92,1:03:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.63,1:04:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yess!!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.04,1:04:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can we take a picture?\N- Can we?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.98,1:04:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.86,1:04:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!!\NPlease come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.11,1:04:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.97,1:04:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.09,1:04:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.66,1:04:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile, Keisuke
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.86,1:04:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, cheese!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.41,1:04:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogata he . . . .
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.94,1:05:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was very proud...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.59,1:05:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,even though I said those things to you last time,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.96,1:05:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.53,1:05:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,when I wrote letters to my family,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.05,1:05:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I always wrote about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.61,1:05:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I said that you have a great talent.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.13,1:05:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the final dive for the competition
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.10,1:05:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, I'll never get a chance to be as excited as today.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.22,1:05:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As time goes by...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.47,1:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I may also forget the way of diving.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.96,1:05:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.59,1:05:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the feeling...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.97,1:05:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that certainly i will certainly
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.35,1:05:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,miss this place
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.20,1:06:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Keisuke
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.14,1:06:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.46,1:06:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.19,1:07:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to dive?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.76,1:07:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,From here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.63,1:07:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I dive for good?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.27,1:07:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach me
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.91,1:08:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.56,1:08:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.98,1:08:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not so easy!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.14,1:08:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.51,1:08:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,teach me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.88,1:08:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.29,1:08:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.61,1:08:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to win
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.90,1:08:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,not over somebody else
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.32,1:08:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I......
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.52,1:08:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,want to win
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.72,1:08:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,against what I was "one second" ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.19,1:09:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one... who remembers about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.21,1:10:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keisuke, hurry up and fetch it back!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.10,1:12:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A long time ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.15,1:12:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,"She" made me cry all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.37,1:12:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even swim
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.77,1:12:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and she made me swim to see who arrives first to the other side...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.24,1:12:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,she always told me to dive from high...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.41,1:12:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,all the time, pushing me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.93,1:12:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.96,1:12:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,at some point,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.33,1:12:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,for some reason I couldn't meet her anymore
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.37,1:12:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...so I cried again.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.95,1:14:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Me... the hospital...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.81,1:14:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,on that day...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.04,1:15:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,if only...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.43,1:15:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,if only I didn't phone him...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.51,1:15:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,brother... that injury...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.45,1:15:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.....
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.15,1:15:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,NEXT SUMMER
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.52,1:15:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'LL BREAK NAKANISHI'S RECORD!!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.73,1:15:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll break it, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.45,1:15:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll break it no matter what!!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.36,1:17:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,kaisatsu no mae tsunagu te to te\N(at the subway entrance, hand in the hand)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.36,1:17:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,itsumo no zawameki, atarashii kaze\N(the usual noise, a new wind)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.99,1:17:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,akaruku miokuru hazu datta noni\N(I thought I would see you of with a smile)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.12,1:17:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,umaku waraezu ni\N(instead, I couldn't laugh for good)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.38,1:17:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,kimi wo mite ita\N(and just stayed staring at you)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.20,1:17:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,kimi ga otona ni natteku sono kisetsu ga\N(at the time you'll grow up)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.53,1:17:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,kanashii uta de afurenai you ni\N(I don't want sad songs to overflow you)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.89,1:17:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,saigo ni nanika kimi ni tsutaetakute\N(there's something I want to tell you, now that we're at the end)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.98,1:17:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"sayonara" ni kawaru kotoba wo\N(I tried to use different words)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.16,1:17:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,boku wa sagashiteta\N(for not saying "goodbye")
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.78,1:18:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,totsuzen fui ni narihibiku beru no oto\N(the sound of a bell that echoes so suddenly)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.60,1:18:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,aseru boku tokeru te hanareteku kimi\N(I'm in a bind [*impatient], our hands untie, you leave)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.20,1:18:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,muchuu de yobitomete dakishimeta nda\N(I called your name to stop you, and then hug you)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.38,1:18:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,kimi ga doko ni ittatte boku no koe de mamoru yo\N(everywhere you'll go, I'll protect you with my voice)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.42,1:18:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... it's snowing!\Nkimi ga doko ni ittatte boku no koe de mamoru yo\N(everywhere you'll go, I'll protect you with my voice)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.32,1:18:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,kimi ga doko ni ittatte boku no koe de mamoru yo\N(everywhere you'll go, I'll protect you with my voice)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.40,1:18:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's snowing!\Nkimi ga doko ni ittatte boku no koe de mamoru yo\N(everywhere you'll go, I'll protect you with my voice)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.04,1:18:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's snowing!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.22,1:18:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,kimi ga boku no mae de arawareta hi kara\N(since the very first time you showed up in my life)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.95,1:18:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,nanimo kamo ga chigaku mieta nda\N(everything looked different to me)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.43,1:18:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,asa mo hikari mo namida mo, utau koe mo\N(the morning, the light, the tears, the singing voice)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.36,1:18:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,kimi ga kagayaki wo kureta nda\N(you made everything shine, to me)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.75,1:18:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,osoekirenai omoi wo kono koe ni nosete\N(I want to put my uncontrollable feelings into my voice)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.63,1:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,tooku kimi no machi e todokeyou\N(and make them get to you, who are so faraway)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.98,1:19:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,tatoeba sore ga konna uta dattara\N(and if by chance it was trough a song like this one)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.01,1:19:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,bokura ga doki ni ita toshitemo\N(anywhere we are....)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.20,1:19:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,tsunagatte ikeru\N(we'll be able to be united)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.89,1:19:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Keisuke, a phone call for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.96,1:19:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.13,1:20:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, I'm Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.75,1:20:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to come and see
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.28,1:20:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.35,1:20:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,there's the student championship.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.84,1:21:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Uwaaaa! Brother!!!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.27,1:21:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The athlete in the fourth course
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.83,1:21:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakanishi, from Sokai University
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.88,1:21:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,with 49 seconds and 68---
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.93,1:21:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This sets a new Japan record
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.82,1:22:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I put all myself into it
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.35,1:22:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That accident... wasn't Ami's fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.92,1:22:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"Don't think about it anymore"
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.29,1:22:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I came back to tell her these words.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.68,1:22:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So---
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.21,1:22:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't absolutely lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.45,1:22:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This time---
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.78,1:22:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be the one...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.68,1:22:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to save Ninomiya from drowning.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.74,1:22:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.55,1:23:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was worth
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.14,1:23:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to wait for one year.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.29,1:23:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really quit?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.47,1:23:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even train for one whole year...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.17,1:23:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So you quit...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.53,1:24:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,without mastering the twist dive.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.38,1:24:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can just say bye bye
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.61,1:24:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,if it's her will to quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.73,1:24:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two things I'm sure about
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.77,1:24:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that I trained a lot
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.60,1:24:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and that in the meanwhile
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.82,1:24:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I never stopped watching you
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.94,1:24:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Always...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.75,1:24:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,we were always the last two to remain in this pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.50,1:24:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason why I could keep on training hard
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.83,1:25:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.41,1:25:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.19,1:25:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The supporter's bus is about to leave!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.78,1:25:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.66,1:25:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninomiya...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.29,1:25:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,recently...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.37,1:25:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you've got always the same expression.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.46,1:25:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What expression?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.77,1:26:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A sad expression.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.23,1:26:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...We finally arrived to the last year.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.00,1:26:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These three years seemed long, but were short
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.95,1:26:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Many things happend
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.28,1:26:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I......
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.98,1:26:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been watching you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.34,1:26:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And you certainly swimmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.65,1:26:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept on swimming.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.29,1:26:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the only thing I can say:
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.68,1:26:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that your effort wasn't in vain.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.59,1:26:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly, it will help your back to grow bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.91,1:26:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.59,1:27:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,GO WITH ALL YOUR STRENGH!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.81,1:27:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeeeeeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.08,1:27:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, do your best!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.85,1:27:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dive?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.83,1:27:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to, do it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.63,1:27:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't done it for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.61,1:27:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm a little afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.80,1:27:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can't dive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.48,1:27:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your heart is confused,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.01,1:28:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thats why you cannot dive.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.07,1:28:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Confused?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.30,1:28:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, really, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.23,1:28:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.15,1:28:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have time left.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.30,1:28:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The competition is about to start
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.49,1:28:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two . . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.41,1:28:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,had already made up their minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.51,1:28:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They've decided that today will be the day
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.93,1:28:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.82,1:28:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.70,1:28:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the place...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.82,1:28:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to escape from reality, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.89,1:29:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like... I can't decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.81,1:29:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I......
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.27,1:29:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,when I look to oniichan,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.72,1:29:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's so fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.91,1:29:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you go to support him!?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.20,1:29:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go!?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.01,1:29:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,To support your brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.58,1:29:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After all you love him, right!?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.79,1:29:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.76,1:29:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I love him so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.67,1:29:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My big brother...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.13,1:29:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,has always been...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.30,1:29:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,since always...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.52,1:29:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,since I was this little...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.88,1:30:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,has always been there for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.78,1:30:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Always with me...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.57,1:30:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we went out together
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.49,1:30:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,we talked all the time
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.44,1:30:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He always protected me...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.70,1:30:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,gave me many good advices...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.22,1:30:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it's on him that...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.15,1:30:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I could always count on...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.06,1:30:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,that I'm proud of...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.58,1:30:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,that I love so much...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.10,1:31:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I . . . .
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.62,1:31:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.47,1:31:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.21,1:31:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,let's dive together.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.99,1:33:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oniichan!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.86,1:33:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninomiya?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.73,1:33:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and she told me to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.26,1:33:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.95,1:33:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,what did she tell me
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.28,1:33:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,that time?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.33,1:33:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.14,1:33:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not something worth knowing, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.17,1:33:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe that you, Nakanishi, could ever tell me...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.48,1:33:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,something that may distract me before the race.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.99,1:34:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.22,1:34:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How odd...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.50,1:34:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.12,1:34:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? And the race?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.09,1:34:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you go to see?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.35,1:34:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have some other thing to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.99,1:34:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A heart-break.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.90,1:34:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.21,1:35:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.83,1:35:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumped or be dumped, summer will come around again.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.51,1:35:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.12,1:36:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to save Ami.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.64,1:36:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.93,1:37:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.58,1:38:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.74,1:38:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.18,1:38:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.92,1:38:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Ami Ninomiya.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.27,1:38:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.57,1:38:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is friday, august 25
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.59,1:38:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,9.25 am
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.29,1:38:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...and 31 seconds... 32...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.32,1:38:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,33...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.10,1:38:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,34...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.95,1:38:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,35
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.62,1:40:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The temperature is 28 degrees
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.12,1:40:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky is sunny, light breeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.86,1:40:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.88,1:40:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.37,1:40:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninomiya Ami over and out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.00,1:40:47.91,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6DCBE3&\fs70\pos(249.101,388.6)}Yamato Keisuke
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.53,1:40:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato Keisuke!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.95,1:40:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.45,1:41:04.85,Song2,,0,0,0,,I've been physically good, these days, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.85,1:41:04.86,Credit,,0,0,0,,Translation: Jiru-kun
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.98,1:41:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart beats fast, I don't know why
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.65,1:41:08.71,Credit,,0,0,0,,{\pos(441.799,440.2)}Styling: Soshen\NENG editing: furransu\NFurther Editing, Encoding and everything else etc.: Ko-FI.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.71,1:41:11.83,Song2,,0,0,0,,Under this burning sun
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.92,1:41:16.51,Song2,,0,0,0,,I suddenly feel such high tension!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.59,1:41:31.91,Song2,,0,0,0,,I got the nerve now, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.03,1:41:35.33,Song2,,0,0,0,,the distances will vanish at will!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.77,1:41:38.92,Song2,,0,0,0,,I want to kiss those lips
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.98,1:41:40.61,Song2,,0,0,0,,I get closer to the target
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.69,1:41:43.40,Song2,,0,0,0,,ant take it at once!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.32,1:41:48.94,Song2,,0,0,0,,"the important is to put words in action"
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.16,1:41:51.47,Song2,,0,0,0,,..and to avoid as much as possible troubles!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.15,1:41:55.63,Song2,,0,0,0,,But actualy things don't go like that
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.88,1:42:00.71,Song2,,0,0,0,,But I decided, you go first!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.86,1:42:05.81,Song2,,0,0,0,,always in the essential moment
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.45,1:42:09.24,Song2,,0,0,0,,that whimp starts crying loud
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.62,1:42:12.75,Song2,,0,0,0,,Doesn't make a step out
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.79,1:42:15.89,Song2,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic! What the hell are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.98,1:42:17.42,Song2,,0,0,0,,"I don't care"
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.48,1:42:19.46,Song2,,0,0,0,,"and anyway it's no use"!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.99,1:42:22.77,Song2,,0,0,0,,But before deciding on your own
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.19,1:42:27.82,Song2,,0,0,0,,you should know that it doesn't matter how you look!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.04,1:42:31.59,Song2,,0,0,0,,Don't stop your feelings
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.26,1:42:39.57,Song2,,0,0,0,,You can't decide yourself anything you do
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.68,1:42:42.76,Song2,,0,0,0,,and you're always saying spiteful things!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.87,1:42:46.28,Song2,,0,0,0,,So what do you really want!?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.42,1:42:49.59,Song2,,0,0,0,,If you're always so half-hearted, you'll never get...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.63,1:42:51.32,Song2,,0,0,0,,the victory!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.00,1:42:56.59,Song2,,0,0,0,,how many times did you fall in love!?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.81,1:42:59.12,Song2,,0,0,0,,Nevermind that and go straight forward
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.83,1:43:05.19,Song2,,0,0,0,,Don't try to change this passive character of yours,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.28,1:43:08.69,Song2,,0,0,0,,but quit it for good!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.40,1:43:13.66,Song2,,0,0,0,,Behind every success
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.19,1:43:17.03,Song2,,0,0,0,,there's the shadow of the anxiety!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.23,1:43:23.59,Song2,,0,0,0,,Yesterday and today it was rainy,\N so tomorrow it's gonna be sunny!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.70,1:43:27.03,Song2,,0,0,0,,It's no use to be so half hearted
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.62,1:43:30.44,Song2,,0,0,0,,I understand it rationally
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.77,1:43:35.47,Song2,,0,0,0,,It's not necessary to think only about the result
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.69,1:43:39.42,Song2,,0,0,0,,Don't cloud off your will
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.38,1:43:56.18,Song2,,0,0,0,,on the line that prolongs a complete love!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.48,1:44:02.12,Song2,,0,0,0,,There's an eden full of hope and glory.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.62,1:44:09.70,Song2,,0,0,0,,You have to change the ideal you always aimed to into reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.98,1:44:12.84,Song2,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.93,1:44:16.39,Song2,,0,0,0,,Engine to max power!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.89,1:44:22.95,Song2,,0,0,0,,so what's the most important thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.44,1:44:26.23,Song2,,0,0,0,,You gotta ask to the bottom of your heart
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.68,1:44:29.65,Song2,,0,0,0,,If you try to make one step outside
