Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.22,1:44:44.81,Song2,,0,0,0,,don't worry anymore about how you look!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.10,1:44:48.22,Song2,,0,0,0,,don't stop your feelings!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.44,1:44:52.46,Song2,,0,0,0,,don't lose your feelings!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.11,1:45:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
